    <h2 id="standing">Where the project stands</h2>
    <p class="disclosure">Misinfo Trace is an independent research project. It is <strong>not yet a registered nonprofit</strong> and <strong>not a 501(c)(3) organization</strong>, so donations are <strong>not tax-deductible</strong>.</p>
    <p>Until a nonprofit exists, support is received by [RECIPIENT LEGAL NAME] on the project's behalf.</p>

    <h2 id="costs">What it costs</h2>
    <p>The project collects public posts and articles around the clock, keeps a daily backup of everything it collects, and uses an AI model to classify the claims it finds. These are its running costs.</p>
